  "title": "Teriyaki Pulled Pork",
  "description": "Pork shoulder is braised in a sweet teriyaki-orange marmalade sauce before it&#39;s shredded to serve any way you like.",
  "authors": [
    "ShanaGator"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-02-27T16:15:14-05:00",
